name: Recover ordinary settings and multiline goal without replacing a newer accepted revision
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | context-prepared
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Common policy context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | context-imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | fresh-study
keys: Enter C-u
type: 2
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 2 fresh discovery passes | two-passes
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
type: 5
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 2
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | settings-checkpoint
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME base
keys: Up Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Shown revision: 1 | goal-base
keys: e C-u
paste-file: @ART/settings-goal.txt
keys: C-Home Right Right
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | goal-checkpoint
ask: Does the ordinary study retain its pass and call choices while distinguishing local goal storage from an accepted revision and work approval?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME crash
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restart
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | ordinary-recovery
expect: Whole repository
expect: 2 passes
expect-not: 0 cases
resize: 160x48
live-snap: recovery-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: recovery-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: recovery-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: recovery-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Goal draft: Goal α | recovery-40x12
expect: Enter restore
expect: Esc back
ask: Does the saved ordinary study have a clear scope, pass count, goal preview and explicit restore controls at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 WRITE INVESTIGATION BRIEF | restored-editor
expect: Goal α
keys: Delete
require-live-snap: 25 Gol α | cursor-retained
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | edited-checkpoint
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME recovered
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW BRIEF REVISION | review-old-base
expect: Baseline accepted operator intent
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Brief stopped: | stale-save-refused
expect: revision
expect: Study choices saved locally
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Shown revision: 2 | current-base
expect: Gol α
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 25 Another accepted operator goal | fresh-base-review
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Shown revision: 3 | saved-revision
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-settings
expect: 2 passes
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | fresh-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_settings_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepared
ask: Does recovery preserve the original investigation and raw goal, refuse a stale save, and require an explicitly reviewed new revision and a fresh approved plan before jobs start?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
